=== HINT 1 ===
Macro definitions:
  #define NAME value
  #define NAME(params) expression

=== HINT 2 ===
MAX(a,b) - use the ternary operator, wrap each argument in parens:
  #define MAX(a, b) ((a) > (b) ? (a) : (b))

=== HINT 3 ===
SQUARE(x) - wrap x in parens to handle expressions like SQUARE(2+1):
  #define SQUARE(x) ((x) * (x))

=== HINT 4 (SPOILER) ===
#define MAX(a, b)  ((a) > (b) ? (a) : (b))
#define PI         3.14159265358979
#define SQUARE(x)  ((x) * (x))
